@wangjunjian/dsh-github-trending README · What it does：In the `web` profile, the plugin additionally renders a dockable right-hand
panel (daily/weekly/monthly tabs, resizable, collapsible to a rail) backed by a
host-side in-memory cache served over the `/github-trending` HTTP route.

@wangjunjian/dsh-github-trending README · Installation：Install the plugin into a DeepSeek Harness profile. The plugin does not modify
the `deepseek-harness` repository itself.

